rs for years.","title":"Gill Industries"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" Gill Industries also owns Gill Electronics.","title":"Gill Industries"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" Gill Industries is owned by Gill Holding Company, Inc.","title":"Gill Industries"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: African-American literature
